      "proseText": "You Let's play blackjack. blackjack Blackjack it is. You start with 1,000 chips. Each hand, you get two cards and the dealer shows one, with the hole card face down. A natural (an Ace and a ten-value card) pays 3:2 unless the dealer also has one, which is a push. Otherwise you act first with Hit, Stand, or Double, and the dealer draws to 17 and stands on all 17s. Wins pay 1:1, and equal totals push. Set your bet on the table to deal. You Rename the table to Kim's table and show my chips as euros. The table is now titled Kim's table. I can't switch the chip count to euros, since the table has no currency setting, so it keeps showing a plain number. Your bankroll stays at 1,000 chips. Set your bet to deal when you're ready.",
